          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 59930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Istnieje prosty sposób na przejście przez wszystkie elementy listy za pomocą pętli <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 59920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby przejść w pętli przez elementy listy <code>final_scores</code>, piszemy <code>for</code>, zmienną taką jak <code>score</code>, słowo <code>in</code> oraz listę <code>final_scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, następnie <code>score</code>, a potem <code>in</code>, <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby przejść pętlą przez listę, wpisz <code>for</code>, zmienną bieżącego elementu, <code>in</code> i nazwę listy.</p><p>Przejdź pętlą po liście, aby każdy wynik wyświetlił się w osobnym wierszu: <code>17</code>, <code>22</code>, <code>34</code>, <code>13</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, następnie <code>score</code>, <code>in</code> i na końcu <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 59924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pętla wykona się tyle razy, ile elementów znajduje się na liście. W konsoli zobaczymy tutaj cztery elementy, kodując <code>print(score)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 59925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienna przed <code>in</code> przechowuje wartość elementu listy, na którym obecnie znajduje się pętla. Tutaj użyjemy <code>artist</code> jako zmiennej.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, a następnie <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienna przed <code>in</code> przechowuje element listy, na którym aktualnie znajduje się pętla. Nadaj jej nazwę pasującą do ciała pętli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"artists\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, a następnie <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 81305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak przechodzimy przez listę w pętli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Za pomocą pętli for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Za pomocą instrukcji <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Za pomocą pętli for.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Do przechodzenia po liście używamy pętli <code>for</code>.</p><p>Lista nazywa się <code>cities</code>. Który nagłówek odwiedza każdą wartość, używając zmiennej <code>city</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for city in cities:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for cities in city:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(city in cities)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for city in cities:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 81306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"A\"</code>, następnie <code>\"A-\"</code>, a na końcu <code>\"C\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ten kod niczego nie wyświetli w konsoli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"A\"</code>, następnie <code>\"A-\"</code>, a na końcu <code>\"C\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetli pętla, jeśli zastąpisz <code>print(grade)</code> przez <code>print(student_grades[1])</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A- w trzech osobnych wierszach</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A, potem A-, a następnie C w osobnych wierszach</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A- tylko raz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A- w trzech osobnych wierszach.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 81307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Położenie <code>in</code> i <code>for</code> jest pomieszane</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Z tym kodem nie ma nic nie tak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Położenie <code>in</code> i <code>for</code> jest pomieszane.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W nagłówku pętli po liście zapisujemy kolejno <code>for</code>, zmienną pętli, <code>in</code> i listę.</p><p>Który wiersz powinien zastąpić nieprawidłowy nagłówek?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for singer in singers:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for singers in singer:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in singer for singers:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for singer in singers:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 81308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> i <code>\"Xbox\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic nie jest wyświetlane w konsoli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> i <code>\"Xbox\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak zmieni się wynik, jeśli przed uruchomieniem pętli dodamy <code>\"Nintendo\"</code> na końcu listy <code>consoles</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Nintendo</code> pojawi się w nowym wierszu po <code>Xbox</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wynik się nie zmieni, ponieważ pętla może odwiedzić tylko dwie wartości.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nintendo</code> pojawi się przed <code>Playstation</code>, ponieważ nowe wartości są odwiedzane jako pierwsze.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Nintendo</code> pojawi się w nowym wierszu po <code>Xbox</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 81309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj instrukcję <code>print()</code> wewnątrz pętli for i wyświetl <code>item</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>item</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz pętli zmienna <code>item</code> przechowuje za każdym razem jeden element.</p><p>Wyświetl każdy element, aby w konsoli pojawiły się <code>milk</code>, <code>tomato</code> i <code>apple</code> w osobnych wierszach.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>item</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 81310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Złóż pętlę for z listą <code>supplies</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, następnie <code>in</code>, a potem <code>supplies</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przejdź pętlą po liście <code>supplies</code> i wyświetl każdy element, aby w konsoli pojawiło się najpierw <code>pencil</code>, a potem <code>book</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, następnie <code>in</code>, <code>supplies</code> i na końcu <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
