            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj <code>for</code>, aby uzupełnić pętlę.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"data_points = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" data \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" data_points:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(data + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>"
